"""The structure pack gets generated by AI; the structure chat goes away (feature 052, convergence).

The owner read 052's first delivery on production (`/admin/fuentes/2`, source `coinmarketcap`) and
replaced the chat with one button: a scan, one internal AI pass and a verification produce the pack
that goes to the external AI. Three schema changes follow:

* `data_source.structure_pack` holds that document, and `structure_pack_prev` the one it replaced, so
  the tab can show what a new run changed;
* `source_chat_message` is dropped — nothing reads it any more, and a conversation about structure
  is what the generator replaces;
* the audit vocabulary gains `source_structure_generated`, and the two kinds the chat wrote stay in
  the constraint as history (an audit trail is immutable).

Revision ID: 0050_structure_pack
Revises: 0049_source_structure
Create Date: 2026-11-03
"""
